    "media:imagetext": "Douples DC-6\nThe long-range four engine DC-6A/B joined the\nHawaiian Airlines family in 1958. The interior\nwas modified to provide flexibility in seating\narrangements ranging from a 66-seat long-range\nfirst class configuration to a 98-seat Military Air\nTransport Service, tourist charter or inter-island\nconfiguration. The seats were also readily re-\nmovable so that the DC-6B could be used as an\nall-cargo aircraft.\nCopyright\n1974 by Johns-Byrne Co., Chicago,\nPLACE\nSTAMP\nHERE\nSpecial Offer\nPrints of this art available 9\" × 12\", ready to frame. Send $2.00 check or money order for each print to: Johns-Byrne Co., 161 W. Harrison, Chicago, III. 60605.\nPlease specify type of aircraft (DC-6A/B). Complete list of other available aircraft prints will be sent to you with your order. Allow three weeks for delivery.\n2015.166.0744",
